How close to an edge the pointer must come, in pixels.
;
; core/config.c:432 label of CORNERDIV
MSG_CORNERDIV_LABEL (15//)
Corner size
;
; core/config.c:433-435 help of CORNERDIV
MSG_CORNERDIV_HELP (16//)
0: a corner only where the pointer is pushed into it. From 2: a band at each end of the side edges, the usable height divided by this.
;
