; prefs/gadtools/edgesnap_prefs.c:682, 707 off-screen requester title and preferences window title
MSG_PREFS_TITLE (50//)
EdgeSnap Preferences
;
; prefs/gadtools/edgesnap_prefs.c:684-689 off-screen requester text when saving (permanent)
MSG_REQ_OFFSCREEN_SAVE (51//)
\"Windows can move off-screen\" is a setting of AmigaOS.\nTo change it, AmigaOS now asks to reset the Workbench\nscreen and names the windows to close first.\n\nClose them and press Retry, or press Cancel:\nthe setting is saved either way, and takes\neffect when the system starts again.
;
; prefs/gadtools/edgesnap_prefs.c:690-694 off-screen requester text when using (session only)
MSG_REQ_OFFSCREEN_USE (52//)
\"Windows can move off-screen\" is a setting of AmigaOS.\nTo change it, AmigaOS now asks to reset the Workbench\nscreen and names the windows to close first.\n\nClose them and press Retry. With Cancel the\nsetting stays as it was.
;
; prefs/gadtools/edgesnap_prefs.c:695 off-screen requester button
MSG_REQ_OFFSCREEN_OK (53//)
OK
;
; commodity/edgesnap_cx.c:3550 spike_fatal requester title
MSG_FATAL_TITLE (54//)
EdgeSnap
;
; commodity/edgesnap_cx.c:3552 spike_fatal requester button
MSG_FATAL_OK (55//)
OK
;
; commodity/edgesnap_cx.c:3563 spike_fatal when esb_init fails (ES_STATIC_CORE)
MSG_FATAL_INIT_CORE (56//)
EdgeSnap could not initialise its snapping core.
;
; commodity/edgesnap_cx.c:3579-3582 spike_fatal when edgesnap.library cannot be opened
MSG_FATAL_OPEN_LIB (57//)
edgesnap.library could not be opened.\n\nIt belongs in LIBS:. If EdgeSnap was installed and this still happens, the installation did not finish.
;
; commodity/edgesnap_cx.c:3595-3598 spike_fatal when edgesnap.library revision is too old
MSG_FATAL_OLD_LIB (58//)
edgesnap.library is older than this EdgeSnap needs.\n\nInstall the package again: the library in LIBS: must be replaced along with the commodity.
;
; commodity/edgesnap_cx.c:3607-3609 spike_fatal when edgesnap.library has no main interface (__amigaos4__)
MSG_FATAL_NO_IFACE (59//)
edgesnap.library is there but has no main interface.\n\nIt is probably an older version than this EdgeSnap needs: install the package again.
;
; commodity/edgesnap_cx.c:4365 Exchange broker title (nb_Title, joined with ES_VERSION)
MSG_BROKER_TITLE (60//)
EdgeSnap %s by Michele Dipace
;
; commodity/edgesnap_cx.c:4366 Exchange broker description (nb_Descr)
MSG_BROKER_DESCR (61//)
Drag windows to screen edges to tile them
;
; commodity/edgesnap_cx.c:4401-4403 spike_fatal when CxBroker fails
MSG_FATAL_BROKER (62//)
EdgeSnap could not register itself with Commodities.\n\nIt will not run. Exchange and commodities.library are what it needs.
;
